A pair splits on its first `=` only, so everything after it — further `=` signs included —
is the value.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md "goal=a = b"
-- exit --
0
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: goal=a = b
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
goal: a = b
---
# Body
